      "writtenOn": "2026-06-11T13:01:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I wrote a test program to check this, and it appears that x420 IOSurfaces are sampled like any other R16 IOSurface, so the conversion is still needed. See:\nhttps://github.com/ccameron-chromium/test-programs/blob/main/mtl-iosurface-x420.mm\n\nI suspect that macOS looks correct because CoreAnimation does the right scaling.",
      "parentUuid": "eb55f47f_ade37f4d",
      "revId": "465305d6059e39b59a15dd87796fbd6dce2149ff",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
